## Third-party files and example data

The MIT License above applies to the code. The following files are not covered by it and keep their own
licences:

- `tei_evaluator/resources/schemas/tei_all.rng`: TEI P5 schema (TEI Consortium), available under CC BY and
  BSD-2-Clause (see the licence note in the file)
- `tei_evaluator/resources/tools/jing-RELEASE220.jar`: Jing RELAX NG validator (Thai Open Source Software
  Center Ltd), BSD-3-Clause; licence text in `tei_evaluator/resources/tools/jing-COPYING.txt`
- `data/examples/`: the example letters, their reference encodings and the model outputs are taken from the
  *Hammer-Purgstall Briefedition* (Zentrum für Wissenschaftsgeschichte, University of Graz;
  https://gams.uni-graz.at/context:hpe), based on Walter Höflechner, *Joseph von Hammer-Purgstall. Briefe*.
  They are licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).
